{
    "_doc": "Demand of permission_sex_dangerday_creampie (its demandEventID): a 1:1 copy of OnAPRefuse_Unprotected (OnActionRefuse_sex_Unprotected.json - see its _doc for the full flow) for an accepted penis-in-vagina act on the granter's danger day without the danger-day permission. Differences: the question uses the granter's kojo permission_sex_dangerday_creampie_Demand and its own text; ignoring (br_push / br_npc_push) adds the granter's permission_sex_dangerday_creampie_Ignored kojo ('then at least don't cum inside') under the push line. Options, answer lines and the condom answers built in code (ActionPackage.SendDemandEvent) reuse the event_OnAPRefuse_Unprotected_* keys. Ignoring resumes the act; a creampie then applies the permission's consequences. When the pair also misses permission_sex_unprotected, only this demand plays and ignoring it records the push for both (ActionPackage.TryStopForDemand). File name contains sex: safe mode skips it.",
